<div class="page-content">
    <h2>設定</h2>
    <p>Googleログインしたユーザーのプロフィールを管理します。</p>

    <div id="settings-login-required" class="settings-login-required">
        Googleログイン後に設定を編集できます。
    </div>

    <div id="settings-firebase-error" class="settings-firebase-error" style="display: none;"></div>

    <div id="settings-profile" class="settings-card" style="display: none;">
        <div class="settings-row">
            <label for="settings-display-name">表示名</label>
            <input id="settings-display-name" type="text" maxlength="100" />
        </div>

        <div class="settings-row readonly">
            <label>メールアドレス</label>
            <span id="settings-email"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="settings-row readonly">
            <label>Discord Server</label>
            <div class="settings-discord-value">
                <span id="settings-discord-server"></span>
                <button id="settings-discord-link-button" class="btn btn-primary" type="button" hidden>連携</button>
                <button id="settings-discord-unlink-button" class="btn" type="button" hidden>連携解除</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="settings-row readonly">
            <label>作成日時</label>
            <span id="settings-created-at"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="settings-actions">
            <button id="settings-save-button" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>保存</button>
            <span id="settings-status" class="settings-status"></span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <dialog id="settings-discord-link-dialog" class="settings-link-dialog">
        <form method="dialog" class="settings-link-dialog-content">
            <h3>Discord連携</h3>
            <p>以下の文字を「凸報告」に入力し、返ってきた返信キーを入力してください。</p>

            <div class="settings-link-copy-row">
                <input id="settings-discord-link-command" type="text" readonly aria-label="Discordに入力する文字" />
                <button id="settings-discord-link-copy" class="settings-icon-button" type="button" title="コピー" aria-label="コピー">&#x2398;</button>
            </div>

            <label class="settings-link-field" for="settings-discord-reply-key">
                <span>返信キーを入力</span>
                <input id="settings-discord-reply-key" type="text" autocomplete="off" />
            </label>

            <div id="settings-discord-link-status" class="settings-status" aria-live="polite"></div>
            <div class="settings-link-actions">
                <button id="settings-discord-link-submit" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">連携</button>
                <button class="btn" type="submit">閉じる</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </dialog>
</div>
